    {
      "id": "_xCYun6nLK83e-zlaFQPv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3180.5194481819667,
      "y": -17.71904205793794,
      "width": 719.8192749023438,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1518683810,
      "version": 71,
      "versionNonce": 1521144062,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786364855185,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For our Purchase Order workflow, we had two requirements:\n\nIf a Purchase User submits a PO, the state should become Pending\nApproval\nIf a Purchase Manager submits a PO, the state should go directly to\nSubmitted\nOn our first try, we added transitions in this order:\n\nDraft -> Submitted (Allowed: Purchase Manager)\nDraft -> Pending Approval (Allowed: Purchase User)\nWe then noticed a problem: when a user with both the Purchase User\nand Purchase Manager roles submitted a PO, the document transitioned\nto Pending Approval instead of Submitted. That was wrong - anyone with\nthe Purchase Manager role should bypass the approval step entirely.\n\nSo we dug a little deeper to understand why.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For our Purchase Order workflow, we had two requirements:\n\nIf a Purchase User submits a PO, the state should become Pending\nApproval\nIf a Purchase Manager submits a PO, the state should go directly to\nSubmitted\nOn our first try, we added transitions in this order:\n\nDraft -> Submitted (Allowed: Purchase Manager)\nDraft -> Pending Approval (Allowed: Purchase User)\nWe then noticed a problem: when a user with both the Purchase User\nand Purchase Manager roles submitted a PO, the document transitioned\nto Pending Approval instead of Submitted. That was wrong - anyone with\nthe Purchase Manager role should bypass the approval step entirely.\n\nSo we dug a little deeper to understand why.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
